{"ch": 102, "verses": [{"n": 1, "ar": "بِسۡمِ اللّٰہِ الرَّحۡمٰنِ الرَّحِیۡمِ ﴿۱﴾", "en": "In the name of Allah, the Gracious, the Merciful.", "w": ["in the name of", "Allah", "the Gracious", "the Merciful", ""]}, {"n": 2, "ar": "اَلۡہٰکُمُ التَّکَاثُرُ ۙ﴿۲﴾", "en": "[✲]Mutual rivalry in <i>seeking worldly</i> increase diverts you <i>from God</i>", "w": ["diverts you <i>from God</i>", "mutual rivalry in <i>seeking worldly</i> increase", ""]}, {"n": 3, "ar": "حَتّٰی زُرۡتُمُ الۡمَقَابِرَ ؕ﴿۳﴾", "en": "[✲]Till you reach the graves.", "w": ["till", "you reach", "the graves", ""]}, {"n": 4, "ar": "کَلَّا سَوۡفَ تَعۡلَمُوۡنَ ۙ﴿۴﴾", "en": "Nay! you will soon come to know.", "w": ["nay!", "soon", "you will come to know", ""]}, {"n": 5, "ar": "ثُمَّ کَلَّا سَوۡفَ تَعۡلَمُوۡنَ ؕ﴿۵﴾", "en": "Nay again! you will soon come to know.", "w": ["again!", "nay", "soon", "you will come to know", ""]}, {"n": 6, "ar": "کَلَّا لَوۡ تَعۡلَمُوۡنَ عِلۡمَ الۡیَقِیۡنِ ؕ﴿۶﴾", "en": "[✲]Nay! if you only knew with certain knowledge,", "w": ["nay", "if", "you only knew", "knowledge", "with certain", ""]}, {"n": 7, "ar": "لَتَرَوُنَّ الۡجَحِیۡمَ ۙ﴿۷﴾", "en": "You will surely see Hell <i>in this very life</i>.", "w": ["you will surely see", "Hell <i>in this very life</i>", ""]}, {"n": 8, "ar": "ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّہَا عَیۡنَ الۡیَقِیۡنِ ۙ﴿۸﴾", "en": "Aye, you will surely see it with the eye of certainty.", "w": ["aye", "you will surely see it", "with the eye", "of certainty", ""]}, {"n": 9, "ar": "ثُمَّ لَتُسۡـَٔلُنَّ یَوۡمَئِذٍ عَنِ النَّعِیۡمِ ﴿٪۹﴾", "en": "Then, on that day you shall be called to account about the <i>worldly</i> favours.", "w": ["then", "you shall be called to account", "on that day", "about", "the <i>worldly</i> favours", ""]}]}